<div class="section-chef">
    <div class="txt-shef">
        <div class="title-chef">Chef ejecutivo</div>
        <p> <strong>La excelencia está en la diversidad y el modo de progresar es conocer y comparar las diversidades de productos, culturas y técnicas
            </strong><br><br>
            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Odio aspernatur, totam commodi eveniet corrupti obcaecati cum perspiciatis quam facilis fugit fugiat hic eos eius adipisci veniam cupiditate ab suscipit quasi.
        </p>
        <a href="#" class="btn-biografy-chef btn-style">Leer Biografria</a>
    </div>

    <div class="img-chef ">
        <img src="{{ 'chef.webp' | asset_url}}" width="100px" height="100px" alt="chef" >

        </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
    .section-chef{
        margin-top: 2%;
        width: 100%;
        height: 60vh;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        padding: 0 2%;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .txt-shef{
        width: 49%;
        height: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .txt-shef .title-chef{
        width: 55%;
        height: 20%;
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background-color: var(--color-rojo);
        color: var(--color-blanco);
        font-family: var(--font-titulo);
    }
    .txt-shef p{
        height: 60%;
        line-height: 150%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: flex-end;
    }
    .txt-shef p strong{
        font-size: 165%;

    }
    .btn-biografy-chef{
        text-decoration: none;
        width: 40%;
        height: 12%;
        font-size: 120%;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        color: var(--color-blanco);
    }
    .img-chef{
        width: 49%;
        height: 100%;
    }
    .img-chef img{
        width: 90%;
        height: 100%;
    }

{% endstylesheet %}